:: Story Stylesheet [stylesheet]
body {
  background-size: cover;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
  background-attachment: fixed;
  transition: background-image 0.5s ease;
  .dialogue-box {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 30px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    
    width: 80%;
    max-width: 1000px;
    
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
    color: white;
    
    padding: 25px 35px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    
    border: 2px solid #333;
    border-radius: 4px;
    
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    
    z-index: 100;
  }
  .character-name {
    color: #696969;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  .character-layer {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .character {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 220px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);

    max-height: 75vh;
    width: auto;
  }

  .katrina {
    left: 50%;
  }

  .detective {
    left: 50%;
  }

  .stranger {
    left: 50%;
  }
}

body.forest-bg {
  background-image: url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1491466424936-e304919aada7?fm=jpg&q=60&w=3000&auto=format&fit=crop&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8MTkyMHgxMDgwfGVufDB8fDB8fHww");
}

/* testing for different backgrounds, will use later */
body.desert-bg {
  background-image: url("https://media.istockphoto.com/id/968272302/vector/daytime-cartoon-flat-style-desert-landscape.jpg?s=612x612&w=0&k=20&c=bXZoHX7RsebQn6i9KX17W7ix6PbRL-AKAKdPjWAkljU=");
}

:: Start [forest-bg]
<div class="dialogue-box">
  I've had many types stumble into my office.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S1]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S1 [desert-bg]
<div class="dialogue-box">
  Violent criminals. Beautiful dames.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S2]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S2
<div class="dialogue-box">
  Even those law enforcement types, who think flashing a badge makes them some sorta King. 
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S3]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S3
<div class="dialogue-box">
  Always asking me to find things.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S4]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S4
<div class="dialogue-box">
  Find the murderer.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S5]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S5
<div class="dialogue-box">
  Find their friend.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S6]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S6
<div class="dialogue-box">
  Find their goddamn stolen pearls.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S7]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S7
<div class="dialogue-box">
  I don’t mind that. The green flows in, and that's all that matters to me.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S8]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S8
<div class="dialogue-box">
  But there is one type that I really can’t stand. That personality that makes me wanna push a guy off a cliff.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S9]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S9
<div class="dialogue-box">
  God, I hate idiots.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S10]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S10
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // The scene reveals. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S11]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S11
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // You sit in your office. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S12]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S12
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // A man sits in front of you. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S13]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S13
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // In your left hand you hold a cigar. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S14]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S14
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // In your right hand is a black fountain pen. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S15]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S15
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // A blank legal pad lies on the desk in front of you. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S16]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S16
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // The rain beats softly against your windows. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S17]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S17
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // The blinds are drawn low. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S18]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S18
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // You sigh in frustration. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S19]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S19
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  Well? Say it, spit it out. Haven't got all day.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S20]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S20
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character stranger" src="images/stranger.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // The stranger who sits in front of you is peculiar to say the least. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S21]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S21
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character stranger" src="images/stranger.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // The blinds block the light and cover his face in shadow. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S22]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S22
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character stranger" src="images/stranger.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // You cannot identify any of his features. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S23]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S23
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character stranger" src="images/stranger.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // Something tells you he prefers it that way. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S24]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S24
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character stranger" src="images/stranger.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">???</div>
  Well, two weeks ago, I paid a man to kill me. Gave him a month. No day. No time.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S25]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S25
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  Which man?
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S26]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S26
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character stranger" src="images/stranger.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">???</div>
  ...My drug dealer.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S27]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S27
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // You scoff derisively. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S28]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S28
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  Not the fastest bullet in the barrel, are you?
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S29]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S29
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character stranger" src="images/stranger.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">???</div>
  Don't. It was a dark time for me, and I needed someone kind to do it. Dug was the kindest man I ever met.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S30]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S30
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  Huh. A kind drug dealer. That's new.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S31]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S31
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // The figure in front of you stiffens, agitated. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S32]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S32
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character stranger" src="images/stranger.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">???</div>
  A man like you would never understand. Sitting happily atop your ugly high horse.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S33]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S33
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character stranger" src="images/stranger.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">???</div>
  I wanted to drown. I wanted to end me. But then, I found what I needed.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S34]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S34
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  And what's that?
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S36]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S36
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character stranger" src="images/stranger.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">???</div>
  Hope.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S37]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S37
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  (Fantastic. Not only is he an idiot, he's a sentimental. That's even worse.)
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S38]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S38
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  That's sweet, pal. Really. But why're you here? What do you want from me?
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S39]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S39
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character stranger" src="images/stranger.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">???</div>
  I need you to find him. I need you to stop him.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S40]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S40
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  From killing you?
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S41]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S41
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character stranger" src="images/stranger.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">???</div>
  Yes.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S42]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S42
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // You chuckle dryly. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S43]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S43
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  What an odd job. I might have refused if you hadn't promised me such a pretty penny.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S44]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S44
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  Alright, stranger, I'll do it for you.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S45]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S45
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  But tell me one thing...what changed your mind? The world ain't a happy place.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S47]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S47
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  Why stay?
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S48]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S48
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character stranger" src="images/stranger.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">???</div>
  There was...a question I needed answered. I was lost. My life was empty.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S49]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S49 
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character stranger" src="images/stranger.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">???</div>
  But after I filled it with other things, my life became full again. I didn't need the answer anymore.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S51]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S51
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  (Damn it. I hate a guy who talks in riddles. Shouldn't have asked him in the first place.)
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|S52]]
  </span>
</div>

:: S52
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
