:: S59
(add dues to pay title card here)

<div class="dialogue-box">
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P1]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P1
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // You stand in an office that is not your own. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P2]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P2
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // It is hopelessly cluttered with case files and completely devoid of the cleanliness of your own office. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P3]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P3
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // This, strangely, does not bother you however. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P4]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P4
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // Mostly due to the cheery, spectacles wearing middle aged man sitting at the disorganized desk in front of you. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P5]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P5
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // His presence, extremely open and trusting, puts you at ease. A naturally friendly creature, a true confidant. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P7]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P7
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // You grin. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P8]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P8
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  Johnson, good to see you. Whatcha got for me?
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P9]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P9
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Johnson</div>
  Hey boss! We've tried finding the dealer but your client wasn't very helpful. His descriptions were vague and he refused to meet with a sketch artist.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P10]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P10
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  Yeah, Shadow Man's not the nicest company. Don't take it personally.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P11]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P11
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Johnson</div>
  Shadow Man?
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P12]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P12
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  Gave him a nickname. Makes him less intimidating.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P13]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P13
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Johnson</div>
  I dunno, boss. He's still pretty scary.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P14]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P14
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  You're darn right, he gave me the shivers.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P15]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P15
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Johnson</div>
  Anyways, we did find some possible contacts that would know about his whereabouts.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P15.4]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P15.4
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // He hands you two case files, talking amiably as you flip through them. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P16]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P16
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Johnson</div>
  Katrina Kordoff - // She owns that luxurious bar on South Street. She's a huge gossip and knows everyone's business. Rumor is she can charm anyone with those pretty eyes of hers. Be careful though! I heard she's a dangerous one. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P17]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P17
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Johnson</div>
  Jayl Sael - // Most well known (and feared) criminal this side of the city. An accomplished bounty hunter who can find anyone and everyone. He seems like a very shady fellow. Keeps to himself. But if you need to locate someone without any clues? He's your guy. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|P19]]
  </span>
</div>

:: P19
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Johnson</div>
  So, which one are you gonna go after?
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Katrina Kordoff| K1]] | [[Jayl Sael| J1]]
  </span>
</div>

:: J1
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // You lift Sael's file with interest. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|J2]]
  </span>
</div>

:: J2
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // Johnson sighs wearily. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|J3]]
  </span>
</div>

:: J3
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Johnson</div>
  Of course. God forbid Detective Blackwell takes the easy way out.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|J4]]
  </span>
</div>

:: J4
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // You laugh. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|J5]]
  </span>
</div>

:: J5
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  Can you blame me for wanting a little adventure?
  <span class="next-button">
   [[Next|J6]]
  </span>
</div>

:: J6
<div class="character-layer">
    <img class="character detective" src="images/detective.png">
</div>
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Detective Reid Blackwell</div>
  Thought you knew me better than that.
  <span class="next-button">
