  </span>
</div>

:: J7
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // Johnson slowly removes his glasses. He then takes a hankerchief from his pocket, and wipes them with the dejected air of someone who already knows they can't win. //
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|J9]]
  </span>
</div>

:: J9
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Johnson</div>
  Whatever you say, Boss.
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|J10]]
  </span>
</div>

:: J10
<div class="dialogue-box">
  // He puts them back on and peers at you intently.//
  <span class="next-button">
    [[Next|J11]]
  </span>
</div>

:: J11
<div class="dialogue-box">
  <div class="character-name">Johnon</div>
  Just make sure you're careful. Little known is about him. Even my research didn't get me far.
